# Forms Rules (3 Rules)

## 42. Turnstile + Honeypot
Every form: Turnstile widget (client), token verification (server), honeypot field.

## 43. Form Validation
Worker must: Validate Turnstile, rate limit, validate fields, NOT be open relay.

## 44. Resend Email Config
reply-to = visitor email. Recipients in Worker config. HTML email template.
